Z||000000||87PegasusGT||05-22-2000||01:22 PM||||Here are the results. People can say there is no difference all they want, but all though I won't swear on a hp increase (I thought there was some), I can say for a fact that there is a difference. The power range on 3.4 likes low end power and starts to drop off in the higher rpms. As soon as I added the Strip chip, at 5500 rpm, it was still pulling strong. Unfortunately, there was a very noticeable drop in low end performance, and gas mileage (could be just my driving  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )||||reg||1
